# One command per line.
# Each task MUST do: low-risk change + local verification + git commit.
# If a task determines "nothing to do", it should exit 0 without commit; round runner will mark as noop.
#
# Example skeleton:
# bash ./scripts/v2/your_task.sh
#
# Suggested convention for each task script:
# 1) make one small deterministic change
# 2) run a focused test/gate
# 3) git add/commit with clear message
